-	 * cosh(+-Inf +- I Inf) = +Inf + I dNaN.
-	 * The sign of Inf in the result is unspecified.  Choice = always +.
-	 * Raise the invalid floating-point exception.
-	 *
-	 * cosh(+-Inf + I y)   = +Inf cos(y) +- I Inf sin(y)
